ives, synthetic resins, construction chemicals, organic pigments, pigment preparations, and surfactants for various industries, including packaging, joineries, textiles, paints, printing inks, paper, and leather. The company is also involved in the sale of raw materials. It sells its products under the Fevicol, Dr. Fixit, Fevikwik, M-Seal, Fevistick & Fevicol MR, Fevicryl, Haisha Paints, Fevigum, Rangeela, WD-40, MOTO MAX, Terminator, WUDFIN, steelgrip, Araldite, Roff, TENAX, UNITINT, fevitite, HOLDTITE LEAKGUARD, D-klog, Zorrik-88, Stainoff, BRITE-SUPER, Piditint, Fevibond, FALCOFIX, and BLUECOAT brand names. Pidilite Industries Limited has a strategic partnership with Hwaseung Chemical to introduce advanced South Korean bonding technologies to the Indian market. Pidilite Industries Limited was founded in 1959 and is based in Mumbai, India.","beta":0.407,"sharesOutstanding":1018540168,"marketCap":1553986617344,"trailingPE":57.9453,"forwardPE":48.3323,"priceToBook":13.845,"enterpriseToEbitda":40.878,"dividendYield":0.75,"heldPercentInsiders":0.6927,"heldPercentInstitutions":0.1586,"earningsGrowth":0.062,"revenueGrowth":0.209,"website":"https://www.pidilite.com","fullTimeEmployees":8835,"recommendationKey":"buy","targetMeanPrice":1658.5714,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"financialCurrency":"INR"},"estimates":{"eps":{"0q":{"avg":6.5013,"low":6.2,"high":6.8026,"yearAgoEps":6.1017,"numberOfAnalysts":2.0,"growth":0.0655,"currency":"INR","methodology":"normalized"},"+1q":{"avg":5.9809,"low":5.9,"high":6.0618,"yearAgoEps":5.7404,"numberOfAnalysts":2.0,"growth":0.0419,"currency":"INR","methodology":"normalized"},"0y":{"avg":27.8173,"low":25.0,"high":29.8,"yearAgoEps":24.1103,"numberOfAnalysts":19.0,"growth":0.1538,"currency":"INR","methodology":"normalized"},"+1y":{"avg":31.5668,"low":28.8,"high":33.9,"yearAgoEps":27.8173,"numberOfAnalysts":19.0,"growth":0.1348,"currency":"INR","methodology":"normalized"}},"revenue":{"0q":{"avg":44709920000.0,"low":43978760000.0,"high":460030